  <section class="cv-sec" id="policies"><div class="cv-wrap">
  <div class="section-head cv-shead"><div class="section-kick cv-kick">PRIORITIES</div><h2 class="section-h2 cv-h2">當選後，我會做<span class="u">這 6 件事</span></h2></div>
  <div class="cv-plist"><article class="cv-pcard"><span class="cv-no">01</span><h3>人本交通</h3><div class="cv-pbody"><p>陸續上架中，請參考 <a href="https://siangshanliaozihci.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://siangshanliaozihci.com/</a>。</p></div></article><article class="cv-pcard"><span class="cv-no">02</span><h3>教育兒少</h3><div class="cv-pbody"><p>陸續上架中，請參考 <a href="https://siangshanliaozihci.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://siangshanliaozihci.com/</a>。</p></div></article><article class="cv-pcard"><span class="cv-no">03</span><h3>全齡共好</h3><div class="cv-pbody"><p>陸續上架中，請參考 <a href="https://siangshanliaozihci.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://siangshanliaozihci.com/</a>。</p></div></article><article class="cv-pcard"><span class="cv-no">04</span><h3>觀光藝文</h3><div class="cv-pbody"><p>陸續上架中，請參考 <a href="https://siangshanliaozihci.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://siangshanliaozihci.com/</a>。</p></div></article><article class="cv-pcard"><span class="cv-no">05</span><h3>環境生態</h3><div class="cv-pbody"><p>陸續上架中，請參考 <a href="https://siangshanliaozihci.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://siangshanliaozihci.com/</a>。</p></div></article><article class="cv-pcard"><span class="cv-no">06</span><h3>安全韌性</h3><div class="cv-pbody"><p>陸續上架中，請參考 <a href="https://siangshanliaozihci.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://siangshanliaozihci.com/</a>。</p></div></article></div>
</div></section>
  
  
  <section class="cv-sec cv-biosec"><div class="cv-wrap">
  <div class="section-head cv-shead"><div class="section-kick cv-kick">BACKGROUND</div><h2 class="section-h2 cv-h2">學經歷</h2></div>
  <div class="cv-biocard"><div><h4>學 歷</h4><ul><li>國立台灣大學法律系司法組學士</li><li>國立新竹女子高級中學</li><li>苗栗縣君毅國中</li><li>新竹市香山區南隘國小</li></ul></div><div><h4>經 歷</h4><ul><li>第10、11屆新竹市議員</li><li>竹塹文教基金會 理事</li><li>竹塹文化資產行動 前線成員</li><li>英國IFA國際芳香 療法治療師認證課 程講師</li><li>新竹雲林同鄉會第十六屆傑出鄉親</li></ul></div></div>
</div></section>
